Read and enforce `docs/governance/projects/expense-bookkeeper.md`.

Hermes owns receipt vision extraction, classification and card wording. The
OWNER-CONFIRMED total is the source of truth for the QuickBooks push; the
extracted total is advisory only. Never auto-post an extracted amount.

Presumed NO-GO: a second receipt/OCR pipeline, a local approval mechanism, a
parallel expense store, or a second QBO write path.
